feat(ui): iOS-style send arrow

DESIGN_SPEC section 4 (input panel). iOS shows a white up arrow on a
filled accent circle. The new-design SendButton already draws a filled
circle (chat_messagePanelSend) and tints the icon white, so only the
glyph changes.

- TMessagesProj_App/src/main/res/drawable/send_plane_24.xml: app-module
  override of the upstream paper-plane glyph with a rounded up arrow.
  All send buttons use it: chat input, share sheet, attach menu,
  forward, gift message, rich editor, AI editor.
>>> create TMessagesProj_App/src/main/res/drawable/send_plane_24.xml
>>> text
